    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald is pleased to introduce No. 5 Summerseat Drive to the market. This fantastic three-bedroom duplex offers a well-proportioned home in a much sought after development on the doorstep of the Clonee Village. The property is ideal for first-time buyer, young family, or for investment purposes.\n \nEntering the property, the accommodation greets you with its spacious hallway, a large, impressive living room with extended ceiling heights features built in cabinetry, electric fireplace, and French doors out to private balcony. Ideal for dining El-Fresco. The kitchen/dining room is bright and fitted with base and wall mounted cabinetry, a guest wc off the hallway completes the accommodation on this level. Upstairs, the property boasts three double bedrooms with built in wardrobes, the main bedroom spans the width of the property and features an ensuite shower room. The family bathroom is located off the landing, completing the internal accommodation.\n \nSummerseat estate offers an excellent location with a peaceful neighbourhood setting. Schools, shops, and public transport services are just a stroll away. Nowhere is out of reach with great bus and train service as well as major road networks (N3 and M50) within easy access.\n \nEarly viewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.17m x 2.96m\nHigh ceilings, feature lighting, a guest wc, and tiled flooring.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 4.81m x 3.60m\nBright and sunny, ample wall and floor mounted units; built-in double oven, electric hob, extractor fan, sink, and plumbed for a dishwasher and a washer/dryer, tile splashback, and tiled flooring.\n\nGuest WC - 1.9m x 1.45m\nTiled flooring, wc, and a wash handbasin.\n\nLiving Room - 5.58m x 4.96m\nLarge living room, French door for balcony access. High gloss laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.95m x 3.02m\nLarge double bedroom with Juliet balcony, carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes, and an ensuite shower room.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.18m x 1.64m\nWith electric shower, wash hand basin, and a wc. Tile flooring and partially tiled wall.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.74m x 3.08m\nLarge double bedroom, carpet flooring, and built-in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.73m x 2.45m\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring and a built-in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 2.79m x 1.81m\nBath with shower screen, vanity unit, and a wc.\n\n"
      },
